complex", "target_term": "余切复形"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "cotangent complex", "target_term": "余切复形"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed topoi", "target_term": "赋环拓扑斯的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "adjoint functors", "target_term": "伴随函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "polynomial algebra", "target_term": "多项式代数"}, {"source_term": "simplicial object", "target_term": "单纯对象"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论余切复形（cotangent complex），所针对的是映射（map），其两端为环层（sheaves of rings），定义在一个景（site）上。在后续各节中，我们将其特殊化，以得到余切复形（cotangent complex），分别对应于赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）、赋环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）、态射（morphism）（在概形（schemes）之间）、态射（morphism）（在代数空间（algebraic space）之间）等。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>为一个景（site），并用<MATH_0002>表示其对应的拓扑斯。用<MATH_0003>表示<MATH_0004>上的一个环层（sheaf of rings）。设<MATH_0005>为一个范畴（category），其对象为<MATH_0006>代数（algebras）。考虑这一对伴随函子（adjoint functors）<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>为遗忘函子（functor），而<MATH_0009>将一个层（sheaf）（集合（sets）值）<MATH_0010>映为多项式代数（polynomial algebra）<MATH_0011>，其以<MATH_0012>为不定元、以<MATH_0013>为基环。设<MATH_0014>为<MATH_0015>中的单纯对象（simplicial object），它由《Simplicial》第<REF_0001>节构造。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n现在假设<MATH_0016>是一个同态（homomorphism），作用于环层（sheaves of rings）之间。于是<MATH_0017>是一个对象（object），属于范畴（category）<MATH_0018>。用<MATH_0019>表示由此得到的单纯<MATH_0020>代数（algebra）。回忆<MATH_0021>、<MATH_0022>，依此类推。还要回忆，存在一个增广<MATH_0023>，其中我们将<MATH_0024>视为常值单纯<MATH_0025>代数（algebra）。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:d7f962c1a1d6d47ee2d58ecc1171846193135a989f8d786d8c9c5d2b086b79e7", "unit_id": "tag:08UQ:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本节讨论的复形，暂译为“余切复形”。", "source_term": "cotangent complex", "target_term": "余切复形"}, {"context": "此处指环层之间的映射，暂用“映射”。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "此处为映射或同态的两端，暂译为“环层”。", "source_term": "sheaves of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"context": "此处是定义层及其拓扑斯的底层结构，暂用“景”。", "source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "此处列出余切复形的后续特殊情形，暂用此译名。", "source_term": "morphism of ringed topoi", "target_term": "赋环拓扑斯的态射"}, {"context": "此处列出赋环空间情形，暂用此译名。", "source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "赋环空间的态射"}, {"context": "此处用于概形和代数空间之间的态射，暂用“态射”。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "此处为态射所属的几何对象，暂用“概形”。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "此处为余切复形的一种几何应用对象，暂用“代数空间”。", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "此处指定作为系数的环层，暂用“环层”。", "source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"context": "此处组织系数环层上的代数，暂用“范畴”。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "此处指给定系数环层上的代数对象，暂用“代数”。", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "此处为遗忘与多项式代数构造组成的一对函子，暂用“伴随函子”。", "source_term": "adjoint functors", "target_term": "伴随函子"}, {"context": "此处专指遗忘函子，暂用“函子”。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "此处是多项式代数构造所接受的集合值层，暂用“层”。", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "此处说明该层取值于集合，暂用“集合”。", "source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "此处以给定层为不定元构造代数，暂用“多项式代数”。", "source_term": "polynomial algebra", "target_term": "多项式代数"}, {"context": "此处指由所引章节构造的单纯对象，暂用“单纯对象”。", "source_term": "simplicial object", "target_term": "单纯对象"}, {"context": "此处是环层之间的结构保持映射，暂用“同态”。", "source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"context": "此处说明目标环层属于代数范畴，暂用“对象”。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "此处用于所构造的单纯代数及其常值增广目标，暂用“代数”。", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}]}
